<p>Resonate with psionic, nature, and anti-magic powered objects you wear, increasing your physical and mind power by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.2, 2.3, 3.5, 4.6, 5.8</acronym> or 200% of the object's material level (whichever is lower).</p><p>This effect stacks and applies for each qualifying object worn.</p><p>Current bonus: 0</p>